        "content_json": "{\"boundaries\":[\"Native contiguous FP32 only; no FP16, algorithm changes, fusion, or Python binding edits.\",\"Preserve existing tasks, worktrees and source changes; never manually edit Todo state.\",\"All GPU acceptance and timings through the CUDA controller on one admitted device.\",\"Read input datasets without modification; exclude /mnt/block entirely.\",\"Predeclared numerical gates must not be relaxed; report failures and actual measured costs.\"],\"desired_end_state\":\"Callable reusable multiply and axpby primitives, generic native example, reproducible upstream comparisons and cost report.\",\"objective\":\"First reusable native moment-composition probe on local real-data slices, plus synthetic cost evidence.\",\"references\":[\"docs/library-design-probes.md\"]}",
